# Build context is the repo root for both images. Keep it small, and keep the
# key out: service/.env is gitignored and must never reach an image layer.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.env
.git
.gitignore
.github
.claude
.DS_Store
**/*.log

# Docs and design artifacts never affect a build.
Plans
Concepts
transcripts
README.md
CLAUDE.md
Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
